<title>UK: Ashanti Goldfields year profits fall.</title>
<headline>Ashanti Goldfields year profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		     (in millions unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		$0.64		  vs $1.17</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.375		  vs 0.375</p>
<p> Pretax		     60.1		   vs 100.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   458.7		  vs 405.6</p>
<p>NOTE: Above results proforma to reflect the company's change in financial year end. Attributable gold production was 1.02 million ounces versus 936,738.</p>
<p>Ashanti Goldfields Co Ltd's pretax profit for the 15-month period to December 31 was $81.5 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
